decision-transfer</span><span>73-theorem-6.2</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"192df17017774c0f\" href=\"?note=192df17017774c0f\" title=\"73-df-typed-many-one-reduction\">73-df-typed-many-one-reduction</a> 的词载体实例；目标语言类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"285f46d94947b99e\" href=\"?note=285f46d94947b99e\" title=\"73-df-recursive-language-notation\">73-df-recursive-language-notation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\">\\(\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"285f46d94947b99e\" href=\"?note=285f46d94947b99e\" title=\"73-df-recursive-language-notation\">73-df-recursive-language-notation</a> 的可判定词语言类。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}6.2}\\vdash\nA\\leq_mB\\land B\\in \\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\to A\\in \\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}6.2}\\vdash\nA\\leq_mB\\land B\\in \\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\to A\\in \\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先运行总归约函数，再运行目标语言的判定或识别程序。前者总停机，因此保留相应的判定或识别性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-typed-many-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"192df17017774c0f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-typed-many-one-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-recursive-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"285f46d94947b99e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-recursive-language-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-binary-reduction-decidability","status":"resolved","id":"4e3aa745a4d7cc44","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-reduction-decidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-typed-many-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"192df17017774c0f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\leq_m$ 使用 [[73-df-typed-many-one-reduction]] 的词载体实例；目标语言类见 [[73-df-recursive-language-notation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-recursive-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"285f46d94947b99e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\leq_m$ 使用 [[73-df-typed-many-one-reduction]] 的词载体实例；目标语言类见 [[73-df-recursive-language-notation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-recursive-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"285f46d94947b99e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)$ 使用 [[73-df-recursive-language-notation]] 的可判定词语言类。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}6.2}\\vdash\nA\\leq_mB\\land B\\in \\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\to A\\in \\mathrm{RECURSIVE}","display":true}],"bytes":1241,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["192df17017774c0f","285f46d94947b99e","4e3aa745a4d7cc44","0a6da8c909717780"]}